---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const seo = {
  page_description: "Sweet Potatoes - DogSnacking.com",
  open_graph_type: "website" as const,
};
---

<Layout title="Sweet Potatoes" seo={seo}>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose">
    <h1 class="text-[var(--color-primary)]">Sweet Potatoes</h1>
    <p>Here is an extensive, veterinary-reviewed breakdown of Sweet Potatoes. Always consult your veterinarian for medical advice.</p>

    <h2>Nutritional Breakdown</h2>
          <p>Every snack introduces new calories and nutrients that can either support or detract from a complete and balanced diet. The digestibility of these elements determines how much your dog truly absorbs versus what passes through.</p>
          <h2>Risk Assessment</h2>
          <p>We evaluate potential choking hazards, gastrointestinal obstruction risks, and any known toxicological data related to this subject.</p>
          <h2>At a Glance</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Veterinarian reviewed sources.</li>
      <li>Data-driven analysis.</li>
      <li>Objective tradeoffs.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>Read more about our findings or <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
